msgid "I'm pretty sure I saw Izumi-chan down on the <Color:7>beach<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Hi there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Well if it isn't Kiryu-san. Need something, dearie?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Izumi's supposed to be home for dinner, but I can't seem to\r\n"
"find her. Have you seen her around?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm pretty sure I saw her walking down on the "
"<Color:7>beach<Color:Default>.\r\n"
"She was looking kinda glum, now that I think about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "All right, thanks. I'll go take a look."
msgstr ""

